        {
          "title": "新春 AI",
          "content": "<p>vivo 手机发布了一个“新春 AI 功能”，将普通照片变成新春照片。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202502/bg2025020408.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>上图左侧是原始照片，右侧是 AI 将其变成新春装饰。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202502/bg2025020409.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202502/bg2025020410.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
